[size=6]The Village Fights Back[/size]

After years of being destroyed by your infection mods, the villagers decided it was time to build their own. This mod introduces the [b]Village Brain Node[/b], an advanced AI that makes the village grow and evolve over 4 stages.

Playtested against the Sculk Horde, Spore Fungal Infection, The Flesh That Hates, Phayriosis, Abominations, and Prion.

Contains [b]1 new dimension, 2 new bosses, 17 new structures[/b], and many other surprises!

[size=5]Requires[/size]
[list]
[*][b]Guard Villagers[/b] (mandatory). Playtested with guardvillagers-1.20.1-1.6.17.jar.
[/list]

